{"id": "C-dedup-second", "description": "Second create — same URL must return same code (BR-C-01; D3 text Content-Type divergence)", "method": "GET", "path": "/", "params": {"url": "http://parity.test/dedup", "format": "text"}, "expect": {"category": "known_divergence"}}
